.TH SHOWLOCKS 8
.SH NAME
showlocks \- show the record locks other processes hold on files
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B showlocks
.I file ...
.SH DESCRIPTION
For each file,
.I showlocks
prints the
.IR fcntl (2)
record locks held by other processes, one line each with the start,
length, type (read or write) and process ID.  It helps to find which
Diablo process holds a lock on dhistory, dactive.kp or another database
file.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
plock(8),
dkp(8)
